WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:02.950
- So when are we finally
going to see a Moesha reboot?

00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.410
Okay, we see all these reboots

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:06.490
and I was such a Moesha fan.

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:08.250
What, when is this happening?

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.390
- You know what it's, it's,

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:10.580
we're still talking about it.

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:12.120
I, I'm so open for it.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.400
I, I want it so badly

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.270
and I think just the way the show ended,

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.080
it ended on a cliffhanger and I think,

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.940
you know, the people that
have supported Moesha

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:19.850
over the years, they,

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.240
they want, they want answers

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.221
and I feel like it would be
so appropriate to do one.

00:00:24.221 --> 00:00:26.900
And I just want everybody that's watching

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:27.770
I'm with it.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:29.360
I really want to do it.
- Yeah.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.193
So is,

00:00:30.193 --> 00:00:32.540
is there a young singer actress

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.080
you could see starring in this,

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:36.510
like taking on your part in Moesha?

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.150
I don't want to give my part up.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.363
I want to do the reboot.

00:00:39.363 --> 00:00:40.360
(laughing)

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.193
- I love it.

00:00:41.193 --> 00:00:42.026
I love it.

00:00:42.026 --> 00:00:43.030
I didn't know if you'd
reboot it a different way,

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:44.650
you know how people keep
rebooting in different ways

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:45.950
and they almost take like a different role

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:46.890
and like somebody else comes up.

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:48.110
I didn't know how y'all would do that,

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:49.700
- Yes.
- but that's cool.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:52.010
You're like me, you like a lot of jobs.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.080
I love, I love to act.

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:54.550
I love acting and I would just love--

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.620
- Oh, I do not.
- to just tell that story

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:58.020
and see how far it could go.

